# The profile that the recipe merges with llvm-profdata of a host and that
# opt of the host reads with checks/hello.ll. It is the profile of one run
# of @main. 784007056844089447 is the hash of the control flow of @main
# after the pipeline default<O2> inlines @sum into it, and the two counters
# are those of the loop and of the entry. A change of hello.ll changes the
# hash, and opt then drops the profile, which the check refuses.
:ir
main
